{"version":1,"content":"<p>無綫一年一度的《萬千星輝賀台慶》今晚（19日）隆重舉行，原定集結逾200位藝員傾巢而出，惟開騷前夕卻突爆臨時人事調動。</p><p>被揭發與TVB導演當街親熱的「女神」俞可程，最新傳出今晚臨時「無影」，不但原定的表演環節被抽起，更疑為避風頭而全面缺席台慶</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T06:43:58.068126+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T06:12:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T06:37:14.819592+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T06:37:14.819592+00:00","content_hash":"ea00d0fe2cfc3ec789b5fc1d25d655f024bfbad7013a77885aa51c1e9f2badd2","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}